    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785910/extras/f60f18061fc0b286f4e09e9b0d833117.avif?t=1750669376\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>Become a bicycle mechanic and make your garage a real empire on two wheels, repair bicycles by your own hand try to assemble frame,  wheel, pedal, brake, handle, sit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player will start from scratch first need to find some tools to work with them on garage and fix the bicycle. There is a lot of people in the town who needs help is up to you give them some help each one will reward you with the money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your bicycle in the garage with different items on workshop.</p>",
